OL,3,GNEWSAGoat sanctuary purchases 16.9
OL,4,Aacres of more land
OL,5,
OL,6,FA goat sanctuary in Kent has purchased
OL,7,Fan additional 16.9 acres of land, which
OL,8,Fit said would enable it to house up to
OL,9,F160 goats.
OL,11,FButtercups Sanctuary for Goats in
OL,12,FBoughton Monchelsea said that the new
OL,13,Fplot of land was close to where it was
OL,14,Fcurrently situated and would provide
OL,15,F"long-lasting results for both our
OL,16,Fadorable residents and the wider,
OL,17,Fbeautiful countryside".
OL,19,FMatt Huggins said that it was the "most
OL,20,Fsignificant step since the charity's
OL,21,Ffoundation".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
