OL,3,GNEWSAGoat sanctuary purchases 16.9
OL,4,Aacres of more land
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been something we've all been
OL,7,Fdreaming of for a long, long time, and
OL,8,Fwe're all very excited to get going,"
OL,9,FHuggins added.
